sequenceDiagram
    actor User as B2B Buyer
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant Proxy as Nginx Proxy
    participant API as Product Microservice
    participant DB as MongoDB Cluster
    
    User->>UI: Selects GPO Laces Category
    activate UI
    UI->>Proxy: Fetch GET /api/products?category=GPO
    activate Proxy
    Proxy->>API: Route Traffic to Port 5002
    activate API
    API->>DB: Mongoose Query
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Return Array of Objects
    deactivate DB
    API-->>Proxy: Return JSON Payload (200 OK)
    deactivate API
    Proxy-->>UI: Serve JSON Payload
    deactivate Proxy
    UI->>UI: Virtual DOM Re-renders
    UI-->>User: Displays Product Grid
    deactivate UI
